Description: native Linux browser picker
 Wye registers as the desktop's default web browser and sends every link to
 the right browser, browser profile, private window or desktop app, or asks
 with a small picker.
 .
 The package holds the command line and session service (wye), the browser
 extension's native-messaging host (wye-native-host), the Qt/Kirigami
 windows (wye-ui), the GTK 4/libadwaita windows (wye-gtk) and the GNOME Shell
 extension wye@dev.soldunov, which is installed but not enabled.
